            "title": "國際｜美資大行防AI代理轉移存款 摩根大通嘉信率先設限阻資金流失",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"國際｜美資大行防AI代理轉移存款 摩根大通嘉信率先設限阻資金流失\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"502\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c460bdd15af209a9761bf73d53273a284636b311b82e2c7142b9da3e93fc486b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">國際｜美資大行防AI代理轉移存款 摩根大通嘉信率先設限阻資金流失</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">美國多家大型金融機構近期陸續限制外部AI代理操作客戶帳戶，避免客戶透過AI工具將閒置資金轉移至高息定存產品。業界估算若大量存款被AI自動調至高息帳戶，美國銀行體系每年額外利息成本可能高達790億美元，嚴重衝擊行業盈利。摩根大通及嘉信理財均表明會攔截未經授權的AI代理存取帳戶，防範帳戶安全風險。</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E5%9C%8B%E9%9A%9B-%E7%BE%8E%E8%B3%87%E5%A4%A7%E8%A1%8C%E9%98%B2ai%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E8%BD%89%E7%A7%BB%E5%AD%98%E6%AC%BE-%E6%91%A9%E6%A0%B9%E5%A4%A7%E9%80%9A%E5%98%89%E4%BF%A1%E7%8E%87%E5%85%88%E8%A8%AD%E9%99%90%E9%98%BB%E8%B3%87%E9%87%91%E6%B5%81%E5%A4%B1-210026648.html",
